{"version":1,"content":"<p>西藏昌都邊壩縣近日發現大量西藏棕熊（又稱藏馬熊）在居民區附近活動，當地林業和草原局工作人員表示，野生動物即將進入冬眠期，出來覓食較為頻繁；</p><p>縣城每晚都有人巡邏，政府加大宣傳力度，提醒居民遠離野生動物，夜間盡量不出門。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:02:12.450480+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:34:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.673972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:05.162341+00:00","content_hash":"ba6ac5c980f8e8e506a1a7ec6d9efd21bd93532c34848dad77757912480ad3a6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}